ocument_title_status":""},"say:44:1720828032:1":{"text":"……俺が聞いたのは、サバンナに秘密の情報組織があるという話だけだ。そいつらは巨大な情報網を持っていて、その手はあらゆる業界にまで伸びているらしい。","source_cn":"我只听说赛凡纳里有个秘密的情报组织，他们有一套规模庞大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x046C7FA1E7855050","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1720828033:1":{"text":"そして、清月会館はたまたまそういった情報に通じた場所だ。それだけだよ。他は何も知らない。","source_cn":"而霁月会馆恰巧是个消息很灵通的地方。仅此而已，别的我什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7F52A2B94D6A4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1720828034:1":{"text":"ほう。ならば、もういくつか無償で情報を授けよう。","source_cn":"哦？既然如此，我便再无偿赠送你几条情报吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29C6AD4BEFC22BA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1720828035:1":{"text":"君の言う情報組織は実在する。その名は「ハーミット」だ。","source_cn":"你口中的情报组织的确存在，其名为“隐士”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FDF70D8A6FAFCC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1720828036:1":{"text":"そして、この清月会館もハーミットの拠点の一つであり、組織を率いるこの私が管理している。","source_cn":"而霁月会馆，正是隐士的根据地之一。在下管理着会馆，同时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3E53E3C9DF888F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1720828037:1":{"text":"へえ……ま、俺にはどうでもいいことだけどな。","source_cn":"……我对这些并不感兴趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE928FE58A212B9A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1720828038:1":{"text":"果たしてそうかな？君はすでにハーミットの者と密かに接触し……取引のために情報を集めていると耳にしているぞ。","source_cn":"当真如此？据我所知，你已经在私下里与隐士的成员做交易，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0CE4A792BF396F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1720828039:0":{"text":"言い換えれば、君はすでに我々の情報網に足を踏み入れている。今さら無関係ではいられないのだよ。","source_cn":"换言之，你已经进入我们的信息网，早就无法置身事外了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60526D3524631647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1720828040:1":{"text":"俺はただ頼まれて、酒場で少し聞き込みをしてただけだ。こういう仕事は別に珍しくないだろ。他のことは何も知らない。","source_cn":"我只是在酒馆中帮人打听了点事，这里的人多少都会干点这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9ED98078B5C1EBB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1720828041:1":{"text":"ふふっ……そう気を張るな。君に害を加えるつもりはない。","source_cn":"呵呵……无需紧张。我从未打算对你不利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B39BC4BB900374E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:172